# Line endings are decided here, not by each clone's core.autocrlf. The shell templates under
# adapters/hosting are shipped to Linux hosts as a bake script and as cloud-init user data, so a
# CRLF checkout breaks the shebang on the instance, not only the tests that assert on their text.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
